id: pm-starter-ibm7
title: "changelog scripts read the workspace with default budgets, so pm-changelog refuses complete-read checks once the tracker exceeds one page"
description: "pm-changelog 2026.8.17+ refuses a changelog generated from a partial pm workspace read (truncated=true). pm-starter's changelog/changelog:full/changelog:check/release:notes scripts invoked pm without --pm-bin and without unbounded output controls, so changelog:check and release:check failed with count=5 of total=46 even when the committed changelog was correct. Fix: pass the canonical complete-read argv to all four scripts, matching the pm-beads convention."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[2]: changelog,quality-gate
created_at: "2026-08-22T05:31:33.468Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-22T05:32:03.104Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-22T05:31:48.619Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-22T05:31:48.619Z"
author: ox-alpha
severity: high
repro_steps: "npm run changelog:check"
resolution: fixed
close_reason: "All four pm-changelog invocations in package.json now pin ./node_modules/.bin/pm via --pm-bin and pass --output-budget unbounded --output-limit unbounded through --pm-arg, so the generator always performs the canonical complete workspace read. npm run changelog:check exits 0 and npm run release:check (typecheck+build+docstring+coverage+audit+pack+dry-run+changelog check) exits 0 on this head with 0 test failures."
body: ""
